nput":"Two real acquisitions of physical phantoms: nylon fibers (1\u00d72688 time samples\u00d7128 receive elements\u00d77 steering angles) and cyst targets (1\u00d71536\u00d7128\u00d77). Both store 8-bit RF counts at 20 MHz; pitch is 298 \u00b5m, steering angles \u22121.5\u00b0 to +1.5\u00b0, and cyst t\u2080 is 50 \u00b5s while fibers t\u2080 is zero.","private_reference":"No separate hidden target; baseline_reference.npz is staged in data","reference":"source-visible ground_truth or baseline where supplied; no separate hidden target established","source_saved_output":"Live generic output/reconstruction.npy is one real B-mode array matching either 2688\u00d7128 fibers or 1536\u00d7128 cysts. The pinned data/ baseline image is a source-visible example, not a participant result. Source evaluation/reference_outputs B-mode arrays differ numerically from data/ baselines."},"task_contract":{"algorithm":"Float64 global DC subtraction per whole phantom; per-angle Stolt migration: signed steering delay, positive frequency FFT, evanescent removal, linear Stolt interpolation, obliquity, conjugate frequency reconstruction, lateral steering phase and IFFT. Complex angle images averaged BEFORE abs(Hilbert(real(compound)))**gamma; gamma fibers .7/cysts .5. No max normalization/log B-mode. No method executed.","asset_revision":"a9de559b54849a25988a8a0d8a5e869063a5a7a3","code_revision":"dc2f668939b21e8312e22529615def610f8611df","geometry":"t0 fibers0/cysts50us; even ntshift=0/1000; ntFFT=10752/7144, nxFFT192. x=(element\u221263.5)*298um; z=n*c/(2fs), relative to acquisition origin despite t0 compensation. Code ERM v(theta0)=c/sqrt2, not README narrative c/2; beta=sqrt2 at0.","levels":["L1 README","L2 + approach","L3 + design"],"live_output_path":"output/reconstruction.npy","metrics":"Source centered Pearson NCC; generic cosine NCC. Source range NRMSE with1e-12 versus generic full reference range. Native data baseline shapes344064/196608 pixels; saved evaluation arrays differ. Generic sole output selects one shape. Task names ncc_fibers_boundary,nrmse_fibers_boundary,ncc_cysts_boundary,nrmse_cysts_boundary are not generic ncc_boundary/nrmse_boundary => absent generic verdict under this metrics schema.","operator":"Correct t\u2080 and steering delays, transform receive-time RF into frequency/wavenumber space, interpolate the Stolt dispersion mapping and compound seven migrated angles into B-mode. The two phantoms have distinct time windows and output shapes.","reference_policy":"Source-visible baseline; explanation rules later only","scorer_route":"Filesystem generic reference discovery uses data/baseline_reference.npz, whose two (1,Nt,128) arrays squeeze only because ndim>2. Output (2688,128) selects fibers and (1536,128) selects cysts; neither is private anatomical truth. Saved bmode_*.npy filenames lack accepted ground_truth/reference/reconstruction/recon/gt tokens and do not replace that baseline. No-filesystem scorer instead requires generic ground_truth.npy, absent in the pinned tree. Installed phantom-specific metrics keys are not generic ncc_boundary/nrmse_boundary; without both generic keys, passed=None, not a success or failure.","source_quality":"FWHM on power-compressed fibers gamma .7 at8 approximate depths10..80mm: nearest depth row, first argmax, discrete half-maximum crossings, no subpixel fit. CNR on linear envelope (not gamma B-mode):2mm disk,3\u20135mm shell, |mean_in\u2212mean_out|/population_std_outside. Two scripted phantom ROIs, no patient or generic full-array metric equivalent.","steering_sign_limit":"The source declares positive angle means element0 fires first, while the steering-delay expression sin(theta)*(reference-e)*pitch/c+t0 numerically decreases with element for positive theta. This expression is used for phase compensation; mapping to measured hardware emission times is not independently established. Preserve expression and declared convention without inferring calibration.","task_id":"plane_wave_ultrasound"